# eudoria-clean — clean runtime for Project Entropia / Eudoria Reconstruction
# GIT CONTRACT (pe-master-auditor, 2026-09-04):
# - This repo tracks SOURCE CODE ONLY for the clean runtime
#   (chain: PCG_9_3_5 bytes -> PESourceMount -> canonical objects -> clean runtime -> render).
# - Original game files, extracted corpora, bulk binary assets, and build output
#   are NEVER committed: they are read-only physical evidence (Tier 0) that lives
#   outside version control (pcg_install\, 01_Original_Files\, data\ dirs, BACKUPS\).
# - core.autocrlf=false is deliberate: files must stay byte-exact (hash discipline).

